DESCRIPTION:Theatre\nhttps://ma.to/event/once-upon-a-time-in-harlem-openin
 g-day-2026-11-06\n\nONCE UPON A TIME IN HARLEM opens at The Roxie Theater
  on November 6. Filmmaker William Greaves captures an extraordinary 1972 
 gathering of Harlem Renaissance luminaries\, bringing a remarkable piece 
 of cultural history to the screen more than 50 years later. Tickets are a
 vailable through the Roxie Theater.
